{"version":1,"content":"<p>開放媒體聯盟（AOMedia）稱，AV2視頻編碼標準公佈僅四個月後，已開始從規範階段邁向瀏覽器和流媒體平台的測試與部署。Google已展示在Chrome中播放AV2視頻的能力；YouTube則計劃最早於2027年初在網頁端提供AV2流媒體內容。Netflix和Amazon Prime Video也在評估這一格式，但尚未公佈上線時間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1583586.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.453462+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:41:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_hash":"ae5ed7c0a69463e781b0c29b87a9173a114d75cf80c6adcd97c7dc6e6b4449f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}